      },
      "content": "Lift the front of the tray, and then pull it out of the printer to remove it."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1820",
      "reading_order": 2386,
      "section": "Post service test",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 135.0,
        "t": 708.79,
        "r": 537.6900400000002,
        "b": 685.2
      },
      "content": "NOTE: If the tray has Fixed Tray Guides installed and are still required, move the hardware to new tray. If necessary, order new kit: 3GY19-67901 Kit-Fixed Tray Guide. Only one kit required per engine."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
